  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "A basketball team scored XXX successful **3-pointers** and YYY successful **2-pointers** in a game.\n\nYour task is to compute the **total score** of the team.\n\nEach 3-pointer is worth **3 points**, and each 2-pointer is worth **2 points**.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nA single line containing two integers XXX and YYY —  the number of successful 3-pointers and 2-pointers respectively.\n\n\nOutput Format\nPrint a single integer — the total score of the team.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤X,Y≤101 \\leq X,Y \\leq 101≤X,Y≤10"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2 3",
        "output": "12",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n222 3-pointers and 333 2-pointers are scored respectively. So total score is 2∗3+3∗2=122*3 + 3*2 = 122∗3+3∗2=12."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "1 3",
        "output": "9",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n111 3-pointers and 333 2-pointers are scored respectively. So total score is 1∗3+3∗2=91*3 + 3*2 = 91∗3+3∗2=9."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_3",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "10 1",
        "output": "32",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n101010 3-pointers and 111 2-pointers are scored respectively. So total score is 10∗3+1∗2=3210*3 + 1*2 = 3210∗3+1∗2=32."
      }
    ]
  },
